WEBVTT

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:19.020
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.360
P-P-Please spare me!

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:25.160
I was worried about you.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:28.370
Honestly, you're such a miser.

00:00:35.370 --> 00:00:38.290
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:41.130
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:44.970
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:04.920
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.840
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.560
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:17.270 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:26.030
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:33.830
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.710
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.590
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:42.590 --> 00:01:46.720
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.730
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.270 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:12.550 --> 00:02:14.660
Is everyone having fun?!

00:02:16.230 --> 00:02:19.850
CENTRAL DOME

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:20.920
THE BATTERIES
50,000-CROWD CONCERT

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:28.740
CHAPTER 2

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:33.720
TERROR! MIAGE-NYUDO

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:41.330
You shouldn't get up just yet.

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:44.960
Old Man Crybaby...

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:47.130
Sand Witch...

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:49.240
Even Rollo Cloth...

00:02:49.630 --> 00:02:51.990
Wally Wall.

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:55.030
Worried about Kitaro.

00:02:55.030 --> 00:03:00.140
I know yer worried,
but yer makin' it dark. Could ya move?

00:03:00.140 --> 00:03:02.750
Wally Wall.

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:05.650
Anyhow, I'm glad yer okay.

00:03:06.820 --> 00:03:08.260
You're drinking again?!

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:09.740
It's to celebrate.

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:14.450
-Your excuse yesterday was being worried.
-I don't remember yesterday.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:17.770
-What a fool I am.
-A foolish old lump.

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:26.180
Dad, how did I survive?

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:30.940
It's because of the <i>chanchanko</i> vest
woven with your ancestors' spirit hair.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:35.720
Be grateful to your Ghost Tribe ancestors.

00:03:36.160 --> 00:03:38.270
Who fired that arrow?

00:03:38.390 --> 00:03:40.270
That's a mystery.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:43.080
There's something carved here.

00:03:43.080 --> 00:03:44.830
It's a pentagram.

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:46.810
It's not just a star mark.

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:50.240
It's the flow of the five elements
that make up everything.

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:53.660
Turn it upside down.

00:03:55.700 --> 00:03:57.740
Its meaning changes that way.

00:04:00.020 --> 00:04:01.350
The devil.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:05.390
An upside down pentagram represents
a connection with hell.

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:09.760
Somebody carved that into an arrow
and targeted you.

00:04:10.670 --> 00:04:11.880
Me?

00:04:23.440 --> 00:04:25.210
I heard Kitaro died!

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:27.270
He's alive!

00:04:28.940 --> 00:04:31.800
So, he's not dead. How boring.

00:04:34.530 --> 00:04:36.890
Plentiful nature, huh?

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:42.730
What does nature do for me?
Is there a tree that grows money?

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:45.770
Flowers won't even serve
to fill my stomach!

00:05:04.560 --> 00:05:05.600
Hey!

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:11.440
Down here!

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:15.340
Oh? What a tiny <i>yokai</i>.

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:19.370
Maybe I'll wash you away with pee.
Here you go!

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:24.830
I'm not a tiny <i>yokai</i>.

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:34.570
I'm Miage-Nyudo.

00:05:35.420 --> 00:05:36.780
MIAGE-NYUDO

00:05:37.090 --> 00:05:40.870
P-P-Please spare me, Miage-Nyudo-sama!

00:05:40.870 --> 00:05:43.370
Good job breaking that seal.

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:44.580
Spare... Huh?

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:47.190
I must thank you.

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:57.400
Unbelievable! This is gold!

00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:58.720
I can keep this?!

00:05:59.410 --> 00:06:01.700
You want more of that?

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:02.720
Huh?

00:06:06.160 --> 00:06:07.430
Coming!

00:06:14.220 --> 00:06:15.090
Huh?

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:21.070
You're Mana Inuyama?

00:06:21.720 --> 00:06:23.240
Y-Yes.

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:24.680
I see.

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:27.250
Catchick, what are you doing?

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:30.440
Catchick-san?

00:06:31.170 --> 00:06:35.610
I just came to see who
the human child that saved you is.

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:38.050
I'm done here, so I'm leaving.

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:45.120
Friend of yours?

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:46.830
Pretty much.

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:49.270
Are you okay?

00:06:50.710 --> 00:06:51.560
Yeah.

00:06:51.770 --> 00:06:56.460
I was worried about you.
You never contacted me.

00:07:01.590 --> 00:07:05.410
Somebody help! Kitaro's in trouble!

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:07.390
What?!

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:10.830
Kitaro!

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:11.810
What's wrong?

00:07:11.940 --> 00:07:13.390
I'll explain later!

00:07:15.590 --> 00:07:22.070
Oh, thanks for carrying him this far.
Here, let's shake.

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:26.890
Your hands are smooth like silk!
So smooth!

00:07:26.890 --> 00:07:29.390
You lecherous loincloth! Let's go!

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:31.850
Loincloth?!  W-Wait a minute!

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:36.610
Humans can't come beyond here.
Go home, Mana-chan.

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:40.510
Thank you for carrying Kitaro this far.

00:07:45.100 --> 00:07:46.330
Wait!

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:54.080
Everyone just disappeared. I was shocked.

00:07:56.650 --> 00:07:58.150
Kitaro!

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:01.090
Thanks.

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:06.410
What? Is that any way to thank
someone who saved your life?!

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:10.720
Thank you very much.

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:13.810
You don't have to do that.

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:17.090
No, let me thank you, too.

00:08:17.210 --> 00:08:20.030
Truly, thank you very much.

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:23.590
I just did what anybody would do!

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:25.470
Bye.

00:08:38.310 --> 00:08:43.780
Koma-chan, that's no good.
It won't strike anyone right in the heart.

00:08:43.900 --> 00:08:46.110
You should go more like,

00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:53.000
<i>"Sentimental like a lady!
A bouncing mademoiselle!"</i>

00:08:53.120 --> 00:08:54.370
Got it?

00:08:55.460 --> 00:08:58.000
Who are you? How'd you get in?!

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:01.480
Now, now.
Let's not worry about the details.

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:07.310
You're the producer of numerous idol
groups, like The Batteries and The Pears,

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:09.370
Akimura-san, right?

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:12.350
I've come to talk business today.

00:09:12.470 --> 00:09:16.120
What'll it be? What'll it be?

00:09:16.120 --> 00:09:17.480
Ta-daa!

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:18.980
Th-This is...?!

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:22.500
Man, gold bars really are heavy!

00:09:22.990 --> 00:09:26.410
You see, I'd like to buy your business.

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:29.720
From your idols to your artists
and everything!

00:09:29.720 --> 00:09:33.680
Don't be stupid!
This much gold is hardly enough!

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:39.130
Not satisfied?
Honestly, you're such a miser.

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:40.020
Hey!

00:09:43.130 --> 00:09:45.740
Th-These are all gold bars?!

00:09:48.740 --> 00:09:52.370
THE BATTERIES "LOVING SOLAR"

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:54.500
<i>BiBiBi Promotion</i>

00:09:56.100 --> 00:09:58.980
So, Akimura's place got bought out?

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:04.250
THE BATTERIES THIRD ALBUM
"LOVE LEAKAGE WARNING?!"

00:10:08.240 --> 00:10:11.450
Eventually, I'll buy
a high-rise apartment,

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:15.040
and swirl brandy
while walking around in a bathrobe.

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:19.140
Swirl, swirl, swir... whoops!

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:21.630
I stained it!

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:25.420
I stained my pure white bathrobe.

00:10:26.010 --> 00:10:29.110
Well? Is the plan moving along?

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:33.120
Yes, sensei.
I've got a big one in the works!

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:35.120
THE BATTERIES 50,000-CROWD CONCERT
TICKETS NOW AVAILABLE

00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:38.750
The Batteries' concert tickets
sold out in one minute?!

00:10:39.020 --> 00:10:41.750
Looks like they're already going
at a premium.

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:46.090
CENTRAL DOME

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:50.720
THE BATTERIES
50,000-CROWD CONCERT

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:02.980
It's finally starting, sensei.

00:11:08.280 --> 00:11:10.990
I'm the D idol, Manganese Ayana!

00:11:11.270 --> 00:11:13.660
I'm the C idol, Nickel Kana!

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:16.410
I'm the triple-A idol, Alkaline Yuriko!

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:18.600
Together, we are The Batteries!

00:11:18.730 --> 00:11:21.190
We'll recharge your heart!

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:22.880
It's a pleasure to be here!

00:11:22.880 --> 00:11:25.070
Recharge me!

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:32.700
Secret Technique
Spirit World Banishment!

00:11:48.920 --> 00:11:51.110
FIGHT WITH THE MIAGE-NYUDO!

00:11:51.880 --> 00:11:55.620
<i>YOKAI</i> MIAGE-NYUDO

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:54.550
-<i>"I'll turn this into money."</i>
-<i>"This idiocy might be hiding a genius."</i>

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:55.620
<i>"No way."</i>

00:11:57.220 --> 00:11:58.540
Here it is.

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:01.040
BiBiBi Promotion?

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:02.900
Could it be him...

00:12:03.170 --> 00:12:04.400
Oh?

00:12:04.890 --> 00:12:08.610
Who is that but Kitaro-chan!
How are things?

00:12:08.980 --> 00:12:12.090
Still wearing the same clothes
every day, I see.

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:15.010
So, it's your company after all.

00:12:15.010 --> 00:12:18.220
You shouldn't begrudge a friend's success.

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:20.930
Success, huh? You can't be so sure.

00:12:21.230 --> 00:12:23.960
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:12:26.170 --> 00:12:28.650
You're up to no good again!

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:31.260
Catchick?!

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:36.640
What is this? I'm just doing
what I was asked to do!

00:12:36.870 --> 00:12:40.330
You broke the Miage-Nyudo's seal,
didn't you?

00:12:40.330 --> 00:12:43.460
Shut up! Is that so bad?!

00:12:44.290 --> 00:12:46.290
I-It's very bad. Yes.

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:49.250
So, where's the Miage-Nyudo now?

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:52.700
It's from Akari-chan.

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:58.680
So, Souma and Hiroto went to
The Batteries concert today.

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:00.750
Huh? They haven't come back?!

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.020
They're missing? What's going on?!

00:13:03.400 --> 00:13:05.200
I'm at the Central Dome.

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:08.260
The Batteries concert
was being held here tonight,

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:14.720
but currently, we still cannot reach
any of the roughly 50,000 people inside.

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:19.790
According to the police, every entrance is
barricaded from the inside.

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:22.400
At this time they cannot enter

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:27.000
and are checking with the construction
company if there is another way in.

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:29.610
So, you set all of this up?

00:13:29.730 --> 00:13:33.030
Something like this is
a piece of pie for me.

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:34.960
Everybody's worried!

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:36.050
Ow, ow, ow...

00:13:36.050 --> 00:13:37.010
Kitaro!

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:38.530
Mana-chan!

00:13:38.760 --> 00:13:40.470
What are you doing here?

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:43.990
Two brothers are missing
who are my friends.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:46.730
Tell me, is this because of <i>yokai</i>?

00:13:46.730 --> 00:13:51.190
Indeed. But we're stuck
because we can't get inside.

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:54.150
My father's company designed this place.

00:13:54.150 --> 00:13:55.610
So what?

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:59.970
I got this from my father's computer.
Blueprints for the Central Dome.

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:02.330
Apparently there's an emergency entrance.

00:14:02.330 --> 00:14:05.040
What coincidental power!

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:06.810
You can hack?

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:11.400
There was no need to. The password
was posted right next to the monitor.

00:14:11.860 --> 00:14:14.310
Your father has lax security.

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:17.550
But, humans shouldn't get involved.

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:20.410
I told you, my friends are missing!

00:14:20.530 --> 00:14:22.390
They're stupid but still friends!

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:24.600
Just leave it to us.

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:27.890
I'm the one who saved Kitaro before!

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:33.130
I suppose it's all right if I leave this
to the two kids and go home.

00:14:33.190 --> 00:14:35.300
-Of course it isn't.
-Of course not.

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:37.740
STAFF ONLY
KEEP OUT

00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:40.890
This way.

00:14:41.220 --> 00:14:42.410
Ow, ow, ow...

00:14:42.800 --> 00:14:45.620
Souma... Hiroto...

00:14:54.480 --> 00:14:57.150
You came at the perfect time.

00:15:00.380 --> 00:15:02.660
Miage-Nyudo-sensei!

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:06.570
Those guys are getting in the way
of our work!

00:15:06.570 --> 00:15:10.690
Hah! Sensei will swallow you all
in one gulp!

00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:16.150
Miage-Nyudo, where are the 50,000 people?!

00:15:18.920 --> 00:15:21.950
I've sent them all to the Spirit World!

00:15:21.950 --> 00:15:23.600
Return them.

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:27.660
With 50,000 missing,
it's causing a huge stir.

00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:34.630
How strange. Over 80,000 humans
go missing each year.

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:38.130
And yet, no one causes a stir.

00:15:38.690 --> 00:15:43.240
No matter who disappears or gets killed,
it's just a number.

00:15:43.620 --> 00:15:47.060
Humans don't care about others.

00:15:47.370 --> 00:15:50.500
That's not true, Miage-Nyudo.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:54.080
Someone always cares.

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:56.670
That's how humans are.

00:15:58.340 --> 00:16:03.240
What are you planning
with all those souls?

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:07.680
It's 49,996 souls in all.

00:16:07.680 --> 00:16:09.600
Only four to 50,000.

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:12.160
If I send 50,000 souls
to the Spirit World,

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:16.750
I will gain unlimited power
and be able to rule Japan.

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:25.760
I have just a little more until my wish
is granted and now you showed up.

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:38.070
Be careful! The Miage-Nyudo
can control air at will.

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:39.230
Got it, Dad!

00:16:41.940 --> 00:16:43.200
Hair Needles!

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:48.810
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:16:51.910 --> 00:16:54.290
Spirit World Banishment!

00:17:02.420 --> 00:17:03.570
Kitaro!

00:17:04.910 --> 00:17:08.890
That makes 49,997.

00:17:08.890 --> 00:17:11.970
Well done, sensei! You're the greatest!

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:17.860
Sensei, there's a <i>yokai</i> and human
with fresh souls right over there!

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:20.320
Human? That's right!

00:17:20.320 --> 00:17:23.780
Rat Man, you've done well until now.

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:25.800
But of course.

00:17:25.930 --> 00:17:31.740
I'll do anything, Miage-Nyudo-sensei,
if it'll help you rule Japan.

00:17:31.740 --> 00:17:34.710
Good. In that case,
Spirit World Banishment!

00:17:34.710 --> 00:17:35.370
Huh?

00:17:36.670 --> 00:17:39.020
You tricked me you dirty old man!

00:17:42.440 --> 00:17:44.590
That leaves two.

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:47.550
Now, next is...

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:53.670
Don't worry about Kitaro.
Hurry up and run!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:55.290
Catchick-san.

00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:30.010
Catchick-san!

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:31.970
Fool! Hurry and run!

00:18:31.970 --> 00:18:36.350
I can't have you getting away.
Let's start with you!

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:38.460
Spirit World Banishment!

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:44.900
Catchick-san!

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:46.190
Run!

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:51.370
And now, the last one.

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:55.520
Spirit World--

00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:57.350
Stop, Miage-Nyudo!

00:18:58.290 --> 00:18:59.920
Remote Controlled Geta!

00:19:04.920 --> 00:19:07.340
Good job, Catchick.

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:09.840
What took you so long?

00:19:09.840 --> 00:19:13.300
How?! I banished you to the Spirit World!

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:18.270
I'm a Ghost Tribe descendant. I can freely
travel to and from the Spirit World.

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:21.750
What?! Then I'll suck you in!

00:19:26.980 --> 00:19:28.740
Mana-chan!

00:19:29.010 --> 00:19:30.010
Ouch!

00:19:30.880 --> 00:19:32.660
Daddy Eyeball-san!

00:19:32.660 --> 00:19:36.790
Mana-chan, listen. The Miage-Nyudo...

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:53.640
I'll grind up your souls inside my body!

00:19:54.030 --> 00:19:58.100
Perhaps I've grown a little too big.

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:04.420
Why? Why can't I exhale?!

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:07.250
Spirit Hair Chanchanko!

00:20:14.910 --> 00:20:16.660
Mana-chan, now!

00:20:17.390 --> 00:20:20.160
Miage-Nyudo, I've seen past you!

00:20:28.170 --> 00:20:30.440
Why did the Miage-Nyudo disappear?

00:20:30.680 --> 00:20:32.550
About that...

00:20:32.550 --> 00:20:37.610
When a human says, "Miage-Nyudo,
I've seen past you" to him,

00:20:37.610 --> 00:20:39.520
he loses his <i>yokai</i> power.

00:20:39.890 --> 00:20:41.480
So that's it.

00:20:41.480 --> 00:20:44.420
Mana-chan, good job.

00:20:49.880 --> 00:20:52.130
What on Earth happened?

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:56.180
Huh? Mana, you were here, too?!

00:20:57.220 --> 00:20:58.110
Idiot!

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:00.410
Ow! What are you doing?!

00:21:00.410 --> 00:21:02.160
You idiot!

00:21:02.160 --> 00:21:04.920
Huh? What do you mean, "idiot"?

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:08.420
Someone always cares, huh?

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:13.260
That was a tough foe.

00:21:13.260 --> 00:21:14.940
Yes, he was.

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:18.730
You've got a long way to go if you find
someone like that tough, Kitaro.

00:21:18.730 --> 00:21:21.770
But, you were so cool, Cat-san!

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:24.350
Cat-san?

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:27.690
Y-You think so?

00:21:27.690 --> 00:21:30.750
By the by, what happened to Rat Man?

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:36.470
With this many gold bars, I should be
able to take it easy for a while.

00:21:36.590 --> 00:21:37.680
Hey!

00:21:39.390 --> 00:21:41.430
What the? Rocks?!

00:21:42.220 --> 00:21:43.390
Wh-Why?

00:21:43.390 --> 00:21:45.190
That's what I want to know!

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:48.480
-You gave me rocks!
-How strange! Can gold turn to rock?

00:21:48.610 --> 00:21:49.860
I'm against violence!

00:21:49.980 --> 00:21:52.570
Wait, it's not my fault! I was just...

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:07.420
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:07.420
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:08.790
<i>Oeoeo</i>

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:08.790
<i>oeoeo</i>

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:11.460
<i>Oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:08.920 --> 00:22:11.460
<i>oeoeoeoeo</i>

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:16.530
<i>Perhaps the truth lies
In what you can't see</i>

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:16.530
<i>mienaimono ni koso shinjitsu ga
arukamo nante</i>

00:22:16.530 --> 00:22:19.340
<i>Do you believe that?
If you close your eyes</i>

00:22:16.530 --> 00:22:19.340
<i>kimi wa shinjirukana? me wo tojireba</i>

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:23.990
<i>A new story will begin</i>

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:23.990
<i>hajimaruyo atarashii monogatari</i>

00:22:24.890 --> 00:22:30.250
<i>The really important things</i>

00:22:24.890 --> 00:22:30.250
<i>taisetsu na mono wa itsudatte</i>

00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:35.050
<i>Are always things you can't see</i>

00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:35.050
<i>me niwa mienai monosa</i>

00:22:35.050 --> 00:22:37.880
<i>Looking up to a nameless sky</i>

00:22:35.050 --> 00:22:37.880
<i>namae no nai sora wo miage</i>

00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:41.010
<i>I bittersweetly counted dreams</i>

00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:41.010
<i>hiki komogomo yume wo kazoeta</i>

00:22:41.010 --> 00:22:43.640
<i>Are you honest with yourself?</i>

00:22:41.010 --> 00:22:43.640
<i>kimi wa jibun ni shoujikikai?</i>

00:22:43.910 --> 00:22:48.600
<i>The wind tickled my nose</i>

00:22:43.910 --> 00:22:48.600
<i>kaze ga hana wo kusugutta</i>

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>Lost in the dark night, oeoeo</i>

00:22:48.870 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>yamiyo ni magirete oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.360
<i>Oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.360
<i>oeoeo oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.360 --> 00:22:56.760
<i>From behind you, oeoeo</i>

00:22:54.360 --> 00:22:56.760
<i>kimi no ushiro kara oeoeo</i>

00:22:56.880 --> 00:23:01.680
<i>Oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:22:56.880 --> 00:23:01.680
<i>oeoeo oeoe o o o</i>

00:23:06.350 --> 00:23:09.540
<i>Dad, children continue to go missing.</i>

00:23:10.210 --> 00:23:12.610
<i>What? Even Mana's disappeared?</i>

00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:14.840
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:14.840 --> 00:23:17.090
<i>"Tantanbo's Yokai Castle"</i>

00:23:17.090 --> 00:23:19.470
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
